<view class="page bottom-space application-page">
  
  <view class="application-header"
    ><view class="eyebrow">SUBSCRIPTION REQUEST</view><view class="title">确认意向，提交审核。</view
    ><view class="muted">先把需求告诉我们，最终方案在审核后确认。</view></view
  >
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty" role="status">正在核对意向方案…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="empty"
    ><view>{{error}}</view><button wx:if="{{authRequired}}" class="primary" bindtap="openLogin">登录账户</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="refresh">重试</button
    ><button class="text-button" bindtap="openCatalog">返回选车</button></view
  >
  <view wx:elif="{{!vehicle || !plan}}" class="empty"
    ><view class="section-title">意向方案暂不可用</view
    ><view class="muted">请返回详情重新选择一个可售套餐。</view
    ><button class="secondary" bindtap="returnVehicle">重新选择方案</button></view
  >
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="intent-card"
      ><view class="eyebrow">01 / 你的意向</view><view class="section-title">{{vehicle.name}}</view
      ><view class="muted">{{plan.title}} · {{plan.termMonths}} 个月</view
      ><view class="intent-detail row between"
        ><text class="muted">预估月费</text><text class="price">{{plan.monthlyFeeText}}</text></view
      ><view class="intent-detail row between"
        ><text class="muted">包含里程</text><text>{{plan.mileageText}}</text></view
      ><view class="intent-detail row between"
        ><text class="muted">申请阶段押金</text><text>待审核确认</text></view
      ><button class="text-button" bindtap="returnVehicle">查看或调整方案 →</button></view
    >
    <view wx:if="{{!vehicle.available || !plan.available}}" class="notice"
      >当前车辆或套餐不可售，无法提交申请，请重新选择。</view
    >
    <view wx:if="{{submittedId}}" class="submitted-card"
      ><view class="section-title">申请已提交审核</view
      ><view class="muted">还不是正式订单。你可以继续查看审核进度。</view
      ><button class="primary" bindtap="openSubmitted">查看申请进度</button></view
    >
    <view wx:elif="{{!context.authenticated}}" class="notice"
      >请先登录，再提交订阅申请。<button
        class="secondary"
        bindtap="openLogin"
        >前往登录</button
      ></view
    >
    <block wx:else>
      <view class="contact-section"
        ><view class="eyebrow">02 / 联系方式</view
        ><view class="section-title">留下联系资料</view
        ><view class="notice"
          >联系方式使用当前认证手机号。提交后等待后台审核，最终费用以确认方案为准。</view
        ><view class="field"
          ><view class="label">称呼</view
          ><input
            class="input"
            value="{{name}}"
            placeholder="请输入姓名"
            bindinput="onName"
            maxlength="30"
            disabled="{{busy}}"
            aria-label="称呼" /></view
        ><view class="field"
          ><view class="label">认证手机号</view
          ><input
            class="input"
            value="{{mobile}}"
            placeholder="例如：13800000000"
            type="number"
            maxlength="11"
            bindinput="onMobile"
            disabled="{{busy}}"
            aria-label="认证手机号" /></view
      ></view>
      <view class="review-section"
        ><view class="eyebrow">03 / 提交前，请确认</view
        ><view class="review-line"
          ><text>01</text><view>提交的是意向申请，需经过资料、车辆和套餐审核。</view></view
        ><view class="review-line"
          ><text>02</text
          ><view>月费与押金以审核后的最终方案为准；有变化时需要重新确认。</view></view
        ><view class="review-line"
          ><text>03</text
          ><view>确认最终方案后才进入正式订单、合同、主动支付与交付流程。</view></view
        ></view
      >
      <checkbox-group bindchange="onAccepted"
        ><label class="acceptance"
          ><checkbox
            value="accepted"
            checked="{{accepted}}"
            disabled="{{busy}}"
            color="#B44919"
          /><text>我已阅读当前版本申请说明，并同意提交审核。</text></label
        ></checkbox-group
      ><button class="text-button terms-link" bindtap="openTerms">阅读申请说明 →</button>
      <view class="notice">{{legal.title}} · 版本 {{legal.version}}</view><view class="muted">{{legal.content}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{formError}}" class="form-error" role="alert">{{formError}}</view>
      <view class="sticky-actions"
        ><button
          class="primary"
          loading="{{busy}}"
          disabled="{{busy || !vehicle.available || !plan.available}}"
          bindtap="submit"
          >{{busy ? '正在提交申请' : '提交审核'}}</button
        ><view class="submit-caption">提交后进入审核，不会扣款或立即生成订单。</view></view
      >
    </block>
  </block>
</view>
